### Get all exercises
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exercises
Content-Type: application/json

### Get exercise by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exercises/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Create exercise
POST http://localhost:8080/api/exercises
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Overhead Press"
}

### Update exercise
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/exercises/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Incline Bench Press"
}

### Delete exercise
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/exercises/4
